OL,3,GNEWSAEnd of game discs could cost
OL,4,Aindustry jobs, retailer says
OL,5,
OL,6,FA video game trader says his industry
OL,7,Ffaces the loss of thousands of jobs
OL,8,Fbecause of the phase out of physical
OL,9,Fmedia.
OL,11,FBarry Oates started reselling games
OL,12,Fback in 1995 - first in the local
OL,13,Fnewspaper then from his high street
OL,14,Fshop at the turn of the millennium.
OL,16,FBut he worries about the future of the
OL,17,Findustry after Sony announced that
OL,18,Fnewly released games would only be
OL,19,Favailable via digital download from
OL,20,FJanuary 2028.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
