OL,3,GNEWSAEnd of game discs could cost
OL,4,Aindustry jobs, retailer says
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe thinks the loss of physical discs
OL,7,Fand other media will have an impact on
OL,8,Fthe culture of the hobby, making gaming
OL,9,Fless affordable and removing the
OL,10,Fcommunity aspect he loves.
